@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] browser-simulation-float-policy
The browser skating runtime MUST verify actual FTZ input/output arithmetic before becoming ready;
an unprepared Wasm module MUST fail readiness. Its preparation MUST preserve engine arithmetic and
data, rewriting only named simulation functions and private copies of their libm dependencies.
Missing retained boundaries, unsupported arithmetic, stale preparation or numeric proof failures
MUST fail rather than publish an IEEE fallback. Native simulation arithmetic MUST remain unchanged.
The preparation implementation MUST participate in the compiled game's compatibility identity.
